# ---- HeaderSpecter output -------------------------------------------------
# Generated scan artefacts should not be committed. The reports/ directory is
# kept in the repository (with a couple of curated samples) but ad-hoc output
# and baselines stay local.
reports/*.json
reports/*.csv
reports/*.html
reports/*.md
!reports/sample-*.json
!reports/sample-*.csv
!reports/sample-*.html
!reports/sample-*.md
